        "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's current constraints or changes in life that might affect how they engage with music?\",\"output_slot\":\"current_constraints\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's current constraints or changes in life that might affect how they engage with music?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"a90f27d90d25a3be2de6cae5c71a5fa2e35c389ff1cc32a726a13efb89538f72\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"3a6c54ba5e64133f4ec1ddc073f6ba38a6a19c78c7abe508fc770826f07a4c75\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"28282d2f3007819748d2c6c6d3e35617ea2929f2a7a4d748f706bdfaf9e7138a\"},\"variables\":{\"current_constraints\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"current_constraints\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"current_constraints\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_4b352877f0ddd3bc34132a6b\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has moved away from technical, analytical approaches to music (such as music theory, historical research, and audio production) because those felt tedious, overwhelming, or like a chore. They now prefer more personal, emotional, and experiential engagement: exploring genres and cultural significance, attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, making mood-based playlists, and creating music that connects with their heritage. They are currently developing an app to help others blend traditional musical roots with modern sounds.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s11\",\"s62\",\"s12\",\"s61\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s63\",\"s3\",\"s53\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s73\",\"s54\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly describes losing interest in technical music theory (s3, s4), finding historical research tedious (s10, s11, s12), and audio production not resonating (s73). They now prefer experiential engagement (s13, s14), creating music tied to heritage (s53, s54), and developing an app for blending traditional and modern sounds (s61, s62, s63). These are current constraints and preferences.\",\"variable\":\"current_constraints\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s53\",\"d3\",107,484,\"User: This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background, which has been an incredible journey of self-discovery. I find that these sounds resonate with me on a level that feels both familiar and evocative. \",\"user\",[163]],[\"s54\",\"d3\",484,749,\"It feels empowering to express my identity through music, channeling my personal experiences and family history into my compositions. Each note and rhythm becomes a tribute to the cultures that have shaped me, allowing me to convey stories that matter deeply to me.\",\"user\",[163]],[\"s61\",\"d4\",105,408,\"User: Now, I’m focusing on blending my traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app that helps others do the same. This exciting endeavor allows me to explore the rich heritage of my musical upbringing while also embracing contemporary genres that resonate with today's audiences. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s62\",\"d4\",408,640,\"By experimenting with various elements, such as instrumentation and digital production techniques, I am able to create a unique sound that pays homage to my roots while also pushing the boundaries of what is traditionally expected. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s63\",\"d4\",640,1002,\"Additionally, this app I am developing aims not only to assist me but also to empower others who share similar aspirations by providing tools, tutorials, and resources that inspire creativity. I believe that by combining our musical histories with modern technology, we can create something truly transformative, both personally and in the wider music community.\",\"user\",[45]],[\"s73\",\"d5\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s72\",\"d5\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s74\",\"d5\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s75\",\"d5\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s76\",\"d5\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s77\",\"d5\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s78\",\"d5\",1686,1699,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s79\",\"d5\",1699,2074,\"Assistant: I completely understand where you're coming from, as focusing on your personal inspirations can lead to much more fulfilling creative experiences. When you channel your energy into producing music that resonates with you, it sets the stage for a more meaningful artistic journey, one where every note and beat are imbued with your unique perspective and emotions. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s80\",\"d5\",2074,2413,\"The importance of self-expression through music cannot be overstated; it serves not only as a form of art but also as a therapeutic outlet. The reason documentaries can sometimes feel lacking is that they often offer an external perspective, stripping away the intimate connection that comes from creating something personally meaningful. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s81\",\"d5\",2413,2670,\"While documentaries can provide insights and inspiration, they may not have the same emotional weight as hearing your own creations come to life, as they can't replicate the enriching experience of your own artistic journey and how it unfolds in real time. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s82\",\"d5\",2670,2896,\"It's essential to honor that desire to create authentically, for it's in those moments of genuine expression that true artistry emerges, transforming mere sounds into something transcendent that can touch the hearts of others.\",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s109\",\"d6\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 168–169 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s110\",\"d6\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s111\",\"d6\",107,504,\"User: I found that my reviews were often criticized for not being objective, which made me less engaged in the process. It felt like I was constantly under the microscope, where every word I wrote was scrutinized by people who often missed the nuance of my opinion. This external pressure led me to second-guess not only my thoughts but also my emotional connection to the music I was discussing. \",\"user\",[168]],[\"s112\",\"d6\",504,830,\"In the end, I realized that the joy I once found in sharing my perspective on albums was overshadowed by the fear of backlash, and that’s a heavy burden for anyone. It became clearer to me that my passion for music needed to be expressed in a more personal, less public way, which is something I’m finally starting to embrace.\",\"user\",[168]],[\"s113\",\"d6\",830,843,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s114\",\"d6\",843,1092,\"Assistant: That’s understandable. Focusing on your artistic expression is more important than fitting into external expectations. Art and music should ultimately be about how they resonate with you and the experiences you wish to share with others. \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s115\",\"d6\",1092,1312,\"It’s fascinating how different forms of expression can sometimes become shackled by the very audience they aim to reach, leading to a disconnect that stifles creativity. What about music theory? Have you revisited that? \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s116\",\"d6\",1312,1578,\"Diving into the intricacies of music theory can be a great way to reconnect with your love for music without the external pressures, allowing you to explore harmonies, rhythms, and even the cultural context that often informs those Pacific Island texts and rhythms. \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s117\",\"d6\",1578,1731,\"It can serve as a method of grounding your creativity, giving you new tools to articulate your feelings and thoughts about music in a more enriching way.\",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s118\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 26–28 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s119\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s120\",\"d7\",105,361,\"User: In 2018, I started a podcast about music trends, but it was way too time-consuming. While the idea was initially exhilarating, the responsibility of researching, recording, and editing each episode started to pile up, consuming much of my free time. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s121\",\"d7\",361,730,\"I had dreams of having engaging discussions and inviting guests who shared unique insights about their musical journeys, but the reality was that keeping up with a consistent schedule felt overwhelming. It was a challenge balancing interviews, show notes, and social media promotion, and eventually, my passion began to wane under the pressure of production deadlines. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s122\",\"d7\",730,990,\"I found myself yearning to enjoy music rather than structure it into segments, which ultimately led to my decision to pause the podcasting endeavor.\\n\\nUser: It felt more like a chore than a passion, which made me rethink how I wanted to share my music journey. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s123\",\"d7\",990,1291,\"I realized that my original excitement for sharing my experiences was being overshadowed by the demanding nature of keeping up with content creation schedules. The joy I once felt while discovering new sounds and exploring different genres began to diminish, turning it into a task I dreaded instead. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s124\",\"d7\",1291,1689,\"I started to contemplate other avenues through which I could express my love for music, ideally in a manner that felt authentic and fulfilling instead of burdensome. This process of reflection was quite enlightening, as it forced me to consider what truly matters to me when it comes to sharing my musical experiences, whether through writing, performing, or simply enjoying music for its own sake.\",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s125\",\"d7\",1689,1702,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s126\",\"d7\",1702,1904,\"Assistant: It sounds like you're very intentional about how you engage with music. That kind of introspection can often lead to more meaningful engagements in both artistic expression and personal joy. \",\"assistant\",[28]],[\"s127\",\"d7\",1904,2267,\"Exploring the idea of reviewing albums brings to light a fascinating aspect of music appreciation since it involves delving deep into the artist's intentions, production values, and the thematic messages behind the tracks. It can serve as a way to connect with other like-minded individuals or even to spark discussions about nuanced interpretations of the work. \",\"assistant\",[28]],[\"s128\",\"d7\",2267,2596,\"Yet, it also requires a level of commitment and time that can sometimes overshadow the very joy that drew us to music in the first place. I wonder if you might find a more casual approach to album reviews rewarding, where the focus is less on structure and more on sharing your genuine thoughts and feelings as they come to you. \",\"assistant\",[28]],[\"s129\",\"d7\",2596,2775,\"Perhaps even considering writing reviews for personal enjoyment, rather than for an audience, could shift the pressure and allow you to reconnect with that passion you’re seeking.\",\"assistant\",[28]],[\"s130\",\"d8\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 105–106 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s131\",\"d8\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s132\",\"d8\",107,396,\"User: However, I dropped out of the audio production course after the first week, feeling overwhelmed by the complexity of the material. It was a tough decision because I really wanted to dive deeper into that realm of knowledge but the sheer volume of information presented was daunting. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s133\",\"d8\",396,649,\"I keep reflecting on whether I could have approached it differently or managed my time better throughout those early days in the course. There’s a part of me that fears missing out on valuable skills that are essential for pursuing my passion in music. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s134\",\"d8\",649,816,\"I’ve been thinking about other ways to learn audio production that might feel less intense and more manageable, perhaps through self-study or online resources instead.\",\"user\",[105]],[\"s135\",\"d8\",816,829,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s136\",\"d8\",829,1041,\"Assistant: It's completely understandable to feel overwhelmed, especially in a field as intricate as audio production, where the technical aspects can sometimes feel like speaking an entirely different language. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s137\",\"d8\",1041,1303,\"Dropping out after just one week is certainly not a reflection of your passion; rather, it reflects your self-awareness and ability to recognize when something isn’t suiting you at that moment. This can often be a crucial step in defining your learning journey. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s138\",\"d8\",1303,1530,\"Pursuing knowledge through different means, such as self-study or even seeking mentorship from seasoned professionals in a more relaxed setting, can provide you with a tailored experience that better suits your learning style. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s139\",\"d8\",1530,1720,\"It’s commendable that you’re considering alternatives, and by doing so, you’re taking proactive steps to ensure that your education aligns with your personal growth and creative aspirations.\",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s140\",\"d9\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 173–175 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s141\",\"d9\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s142\",\"d9\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s143\",\"d9\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s144\",\"d9\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s145\",\"d9\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s146\",\"d9\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s147\",\"d9\",1515,1528,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s148\",\"d9\",1528,1828,\"Assistant: That’s a bold move indeed! It takes a lot of courage and conviction to step away from the comfort of remixing well-known pieces and to delve into the vast realm of original creation. Are there other genres or styles you're exploring during this time that could inspire your original work? \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s149\",\"d9\",1828,2095,\"Engaging with different sounds and cultural musical traditions can provide a wealth of inspiration, opening doors to innovative ideas and fresh perspectives. The journey into your own music can be deeply fulfilling, and I commend you for daring to explore this path. \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s150\",\"d9\",2095,2440,\"Perhaps you're thinking about blending elements you've encountered in your explorations, or maybe you're considering how to express your personal narrative through original compositions. Discovering and experimenting with diverse influences will not only enrich your musical palette but also provide new avenues for your creativity to flourish. \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s151\",\"d9\",2440,2570,\"I would love to hear more about the specific styles that have piqued your interest and how they might influence your unique sound.\",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s152\",\"d10\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 29–31 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s153\",\"d10\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s154\",\"d10\",105,368,\"User: I tried reviewing an album in 2019, but that didn't stick either, as it felt unproductive. I think I was attempting to analyze the music in a way that didn't align with my natural style, which is often more spontaneous and emotional rather than analytical. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s155\",\"d10\",368,648,\"The process felt like I was forcing myself to conform to a template, which drained the fun out of it, as I was trying to fit into a mold that didn't suit me. It was disheartening because I love music in its truest form, without rigid guidelines dictating how I should dissect it. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s156\",\"d10\",648,906,\"This experience prompted me to consider alternative methods of connecting with music, such as sharing my playlists or even discussing music with friends, rather than feeling pressured to produce polished reviews.\\n\\nUser: There’s just so much more to explore! \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s157\",\"d10\",906,1276,\"Joining an online music community felt like opening a door to an entire universe of sounds, genres, and artists that I had either never encountered or really only skimmed the surface of before. With each click, I was greeted by recommendations that spanned from obscure indie bands to historical records of jazz legends that have shaped the music landscape for decades. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s158\",\"d10\",1276,1603,\"It was exhilarating to discover how many styles there are, whether it's the evolving sound of electronic music or the soulful richness of classical compositions. However, despite this vast array of choices, the sheer volume of content often left me feeling inundated and unsure of where to focus my limited time and attention. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s159\",\"d10\",1603,1800,\"I remember browsing through discussions that stretched on for pages about new releases or vintage hits, and it sometimes felt daunting to keep up with everyone’s excitement and extensive knowledge.\",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s160\",\"d10\",1800,1813,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s161\",\"d10\",1813,2150,\"Assistant: I completely understand the overwhelming sensation you're describing when diving into an online music community; it truly resembles trying to drink from a fire hydrant! Each new member brings their unique experiences, insights, and preferences, which can enrich the conversation but also complicate one’s own musical journey. \",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s162\",\"d10\",2150,2435,\"The thrill of discovering new artists and genres can be heightened by the thoughtful discussions and recommendations shared amongst fellow music lovers, yet, paradoxically, this can also create a sense of pressure to explore every recommendation and participate in every conversation. \",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s163\",\"d10\",2435,2686,\"This fine balance between gaining knowledge and feeling lost is part and parcel of engaging with such a lively environment; in essence, it’s important to remember that music exploration should be a joy, not just a checklist of albums to keep up with. \",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s164\",\"d10\",2686,2918,\"Embracing the process of discovery without the burden of expectation can lead to a much more fulfilling experience, where you can savor each new sound pattern at your own pace and truly appreciate what resonates with you personally.\",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s165\",\"d11\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 97–99 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s166\",\"d11\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s167\",\"d11\",105,366,\"User: I watched a poorly-rated music documentary, and honestly, I regretted the time spent on it. Despite the intriguing premise that promised to explore the depths of a particular genre, the execution fell flat, leaving me feeling dissatisfied and frustrated. \",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s168\",\"d11\",366,753,\"The narrative seemed disjointed and lacking in genuine insight, which is a shame because I was genuinely interested in the topic it aimed to cover. I found myself checking the time often, wishing it would finish so I could move on to something more engaging. It’s disappointing when a film fails to capture the essence of its subject, especially in a genre as rich and varied as music.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s169\",\"d11\",753,1114,\"User: It felt sensationalized and disconnected me from the medium again. The narrative seemed to prioritize dramatic storytelling over authenticity, which completely undermined the musical elements that I usually find so compelling. I long for documentaries that take a more nuanced approach, offering genuine insights into the artists and genres they profile. \",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s170\",\"d11\",1114,1368,\"This recent viewing made me feel as if I was being fed a diluted version of something that deserved much more attention and care. It’s disheartening because music documentaries can inspire and educate, yet this one left me feeling empty and uninterested.\",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s171\",\"d11\",1368,1381,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s172\",\"d11\",1381,1735,\"Assistant: That can be disappointing, especially if you're looking for depth and connection. Music documentaries have the potential to unlock profound stories, enriching our understanding of different cultures and musical influences across the globe. When they fail to achieve this, it’s like a missed opportunity for both the creators and the audience. \",\"assistant\",[99]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"current_constraints\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_4b352877f0ddd3bc34132a6b\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s11\",\"s62\",\"s12\",\"s61\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s63\",\"s3\",\"s53\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s73\",\"s54\"]}},\"repair_scope\":{\"failed\":[{\"variable\":\"current_constraints\",\"id\":\"*\",\"feedback\":\"Provider explicitly truncated reasoning output\",\"observation\":null,\"slot\":null}],\"attempt\":1,\"previous_response_identity\":\"5fbe2191679e6cb026e6c98e59dcf641267979298f23cc2f4b09c95f2d295e27\",\"invalid_response\":\"{\\n  \\\"slots\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"variable\\\": \\\"curren